QZone Archiver for macOS
Copyright 2026 contributors

This project is a macOS platform port of:

  salt-fishes/qzone-archiver
  https://github.com/salt-fishes/qzone-archiver

Pinned upstream source:

  version: v4.0.0
  commit: 63967a184b44ea3eaf339f0abac72bb5244c0a75
  license: Apache License 2.0

The upstream project itself is based on ShunCai/QZoneExport.

macOS-specific work in this repository includes:

- electron-builder DMG / ZIP targets
- Apple Silicon arm64 packaging
- Intel x64 packaging
- native macOS application menu behaviour
- macOS title-bar / window behaviour
- automated macOS builds and release packaging
- macOS user documentation

The QQ Space collection, export, archive viewer and deleted-post recovery engine are retained from upstream rather than claimed as original work of this port.

Modified upstream files are marked by the macOS patcher where applicable, consistent with Apache License 2.0 redistribution requirements.
